[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_CHANGELINGS]
Approach Changelings

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_CHANGELINGS_desc]
The Changeling Empire, as a third party force that does not belong to ponies, is a powerful empire. Getting their support will greatly enhance the negotiation chips of Lomage in all subsequent business cooperation. At the same time... The military and intelligence capabilities of the Changelings may also be useful to us...

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_CHANGELINGS_OPINION_MODIFIER]
Trade Contact

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_CHANGELINGS]
亲近幻形灵

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_CHANGELINGS_desc]
幻形灵帝国，作为不属于小马的第三方势力，又是一个强大的帝国，获得他们的支持将会大大增强洛马基在后续所有商业合作中的谈判筹码。与此同时... 幻形灵的军事和情报能力可能也能为我们所用...

